    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "IIIRC the main problem was that `setState` was called multiple times with different values. From the `onEnd` listener and inside `stop` (via `resetState`). From what I've understood, now they are called with the same values. But the function is still called two times no?",
